 "personnel_groups_about": "b77 p6s (GOAL P4): the native category target 0x209FE0 puts third and 7+ at personnel codes 9-10, where the stock Flush group fields 10 personnel (4 WR), so every book collapsed to 10 personnel on third and long while 2025 NFL offenses used 11 personnel on 86% of those snaps (pb/research/situational_2025.json). The default turns the book's Flush record (else Queens) into 'Kings Long': the same eleven players as Kings at code 9. The third-down shotgun 11 sets are owned by Kings Long; every 11 personnel set lists both groups (the category mean 0x208120 averages members, the formation lottery 0x2081B0 draws owners). Ratings and these groups were fitted with pb/v2/fit_cpu.py --league (2025 league-mean targets) on the KC book. A team package that sets its own personnel_groups / formation_groups replaces these defaults (TEN does).",
